            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.10.5+ISA.10.6+ISA.10.7+ISA.10.8+ISA.10.9+ISA.10.10+ISA.10.11+ISA.10.12+ISA.10.13+ISA.10.14+ISA.10.15+ISA.10.16+ISA.10.17+ISA.10.18+ISA.10.19+ISA.10.20+ISA.10.21+ISA.10.22+ISA.10.23+ISA.10.24+ISA.10.25+ISA.10.26+ISA.10.27+ISA.10.28+ISA.10.29+ISA.10.30+ISA.10.31+ISA.10.32+ISA.10.33+ISA.10.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 10:5-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Nah 1:1-3:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.13+ZEP.2.14+ZEP.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 2:13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova mir udul ukwong’o kwong’, ewacu kumae, Andha, calu ia pido, ebitimbre kumeca; man calu akeco, ebicungo kumeca: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nia abituro Jaascuri i ng’om para, man abinyone the tielo wi gudi para: e mberembere pare bilund ai kud i kumgi, man ter pare biai kud i gokgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni en e lembakeca ma jukeco wi ng’om ngung’; man maeni en e cing’ ma jurieyo wi thek ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova mir udul ukeco, man ng’a ma bithire? man cinge rieire, e ng’a ma bidole?",
