        {
          "text": "Anyong’a kud unegi, E Filistia ceke, kum uluth m’ugoi tur; kum bunyo biwok kud i ulag thwol, man nyinge bibedo thwol mi mac ma ringo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
