              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kayu pa jacan bicamu, man jacanpiny bivuto museme; e abinego ulegi ku ndru, man jubinego dongi m’udong’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goi nduru, E dhugang’; ywaki, E adhura; ing’oi nwe, E Filistia ceke; kum yiro ai ku yor ariwa ma malu, man ng’atu m’udong’ cen umbe i piro pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubilund loko lembang’o ni jukwenda mi theki? Nia Yehova guro the Sayuni, man ju ma jusendo mi dhanu pare bipondo i ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.32"
            ]
